	(text "Preliminary M.2 key E pinout (standard names in brackets)\n\nUsed now:\n  8 I2S_BCLK (PCM_CLK), 10 I2S_WS (PCM_SYNC)\n  12 I2S_RX (PCM_IN), 14 I2S_TX (PCM_OUT)\n  9 SPI_SCK (SDIO_CLK), 11 SPI_MOSI (SDIO_CMD)\n  13 SPI_MISO (SDIO_DATA0), 15 SX_CS (SDIO_DATA1)\n  23 SX_RESET (SDIO_RESET), 38 ID_SD, 40 ID_SC (VENDOR_DEFINED)\n\nReserved for the next revision:\n  17 ATT_LE1, 19 ATT_LE2, 54 ATT_LE3 (PE4312)\n  56 PLL_LE, 62 PLL_MUXOUT (ADF4002)\n  50 REF_10M (SUSCLK), 44 PPS (COEX3)\n  58 I2C_SDA, 60 I2C_SCL (no pull-ups on the card)\n  22 UART_RX, 32 UART_TX"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 64.77 0)
		(effects
